-    * That is the honest answer while OpenResource is not implemented, and it
-    * is also why nothing composed through DWM (the logon screen, the shell)
-    * ever shows on maliwddm. For experiments, the file C:\mali\redirect
-    * switches to S_OK, so the log shows what DXGI and DWM ask for next.
+    *
+    * A swap chain for composition has nothing to present to but DWM. With
+    * NO_REDIRECTION its first Present1 comes back from pfnPresentCb with
+    * D3DDDIERR_INVALIDHANDLE and the runtime removes the device: at WDDM
+    * 1.3 (2026-11-23, run A) and again at 2.0 (2026-11-24, d3dprobe
+    * sandbox, all three tokens; Edge's GPU process the same), while
+    * window swap chains present fine either way. With redirection allowed
+    * the composition path passed at 1.3 (run B, round 6: Edge rendered,
+    * DWM alive). So the browsers, which present through DirectComposition,
+    * get S_OK by default (docs/EDGE-PRESENT.md, "Edge at WDDM 2.0"); every
